Test enabling the maintenance mode on a node that keeps the guest identity,
where one of the other nodes runs a Proxmox VE version that would drop it.

The expected outcome is:
- vm:101 is migrated to node3
- The migration of vm:103 and the relocation of ct:102 to node2 are refused
  before the services are stopped. Both keep running on node1
- As for any move that keeps failing, the CRM retries vm:103 and ct:102 with
  node2 until the maintenance mode is disabled again
- vm:101 is migrated back to node1 after the maintenance mode is disabled
